 in College Station","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Listed at 1000 Krenek Tap Road and open daily March 1–October 31, 8 a.m.–9 p.m.; follow park rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"wa-tarrow-splash-pad","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"W.A. Tarrow Splash Pad","title":"Visit W.A. Tarrow Splash Pad","subtitle":"Next to Lincoln Recreation Center","notes":"Plan a daytime meetup around the spray features, then check the city notice before leaving because the surrounding recreation area has had improvement work.","short_summary":"A public splash-pad outing with no admission fee.","evidence_claim":"W.A. Tarrow Splash Pad has no admission fee and is open to the public.","source_url":"https://visit.cstx.gov/blog/water-parks-splash-pads-college-station/","source_title":"Water Parks and Splash Pads in College Station","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Listed at 1000 Eleanor Street; verify current operating status because city-area improvements may affect access.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"trivia-on-the-green","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Trivia on the Green","title":"Join Trivia on the Green","subtitle":"Century Square, 144 Century Court","notes":"Form a small team and play the weekly categories at The Green. Buying food or drinks nearby is optional, so arrive ready to participate without a purchase.","short_summary":"A recurring free Thursday trivia night at Century Square.","evidence_claim":"Trivia on the Green is free and is scheduled weekly on Thursdays, including dates after August 13, 2026.","source_url":"https://visit.cstx.gov/events/trivia-on-the-green/","source_title":"Trivia on the Green — Visit College Station","source_kind":"government","source_published_